          "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 7 | Part-II"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.087,
            0.72,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": "? Find the average price of onions at Yahapur and Wahapur."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.113,
            0.848,
            0.208
          ],
          "content": "A statement such as, “The price of onions is ₹35 per kilo”, may not trigger any further questions. But looking at variations in data, like the prices of onions over a year in Yahapur and Wahapur, can spark one’s curiosity. For example, one might be curious to know more about the two locations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.209,
            0.363,
            0.229
          ],
          "content": "You might wonder —"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.309,
            0.329,
            0.358
          ],
          "content": "Do the seasons affect the price of onions?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.376,
            0.276,
            0.534,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": "Where are these two locations? Are they close to each other or far apart?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.227,
            0.862,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_7_image_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.578,
            0.262,
            0.716,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": "What are the factors that determine the price of onions?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.487,
            0.521,
            0.599,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": "What other commodities might have similar patterns?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.642,
            0.475,
            0.665
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "What else do you wonder about?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
            0.622,
            0.904,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": "",
